Package: hifiberry-vu-meter
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         pipewire,
         nginx
Description: HiFiBerry VU Meter Service
 Real-time audio level monitoring service for HiFiBerry OS.
 Captures audio levels from PipeWire and streams them via
 WebSocket using a compact binary protocol.
 .
 Provides stereo RMS, peak, and clipping detection at 10Hz
 for the HiFiBerry web UI VU meter display.
